Package: GBOP2
Type: Package
Title: Generalized Bayesian Optimal Phase II Design (G-BOP2)
Version: 0.1.4
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Authors@R: c(person("Xinying", "Fang", role = c("aut")),
